  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread pork, onion, bell pepper, and mushroom onto skewers.",
    "3. Brush skewers with sesame oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "4. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "5. Meanwhile, mix vivid jam and soy sauce in a small bowl.",
    "6. Brush skewers with vivid glaze during last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Garnish with chopped redcurrant.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
